  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "國際企業經營與管理",
    "sub_ename": "INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "在全球化競爭的時代，企業的市場、供應商，和競爭者都來自不同國家，而這些國家的政治、經濟、社會、文化、和歷史都會深刻影響所有企業的經營思維、策略規劃、組織建構和管理實務。本課程旨在探討全球經營管理與產經趨勢，亦會從產業全球化、企業國際化、及管理在地與全球化等議題進行研討。",
    "describe_eh": "In the era of global competition, companies’ markets, suppliers, and competitors all come from different countries. Moreover, the politics, economy, society, culture, and history of these countries will affect the management practices of enterprises. This course aims to explore global management and economic and industrial trends, as well as discuss topics such as industrial globalization, enterprises internationalization, and localization and globalization of management.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
